# The QEMU image `tools/qemu-run.sh fetch` downloads: the GitHub release
# tools/qemu-image.sh --publish made (zyperos-qemu.tar.xz on it), and the
# archive's sha256, which fetch checks before it unpacks anything. Written by
# tools/qemu-image.sh --publish; a new image is a new release and a new pin.
# Empty while no image is published: build one with plastron's make qemu.
tag=
sha256=
